  "evidence": [
    "Independent pinned/native audit found six direct code pushes of939FF0: Console cursor_next5109D5, Console on_key_click518931/5189BD/5189EE/519F80, faction add_site579B95. The byte is zero-initialized storage, also pointed to by two empty zlib error-table entries698E18/698E34. This supports the ordinary empty string, not a Console object/array or inferred extension of the six-byte ConsoleKeyByteRegion at939FE0. Source add_site already spells the corresponding second argument as an empty literal.",
    "Authorize only cursor_next fixed CursorNextDangerMsg2 replacement with ordinary empty literal, and the four precisely corresponding on_key_click danger second arguments currently StringTable.get(0). Independently verify each original call/argument before changing it; StringTable.get(0) is initialized to -Nil-, not an empty string, and danger forwards/logs it. No other StringTable calls, debug behavior, null/error checks, buffers, flags, method structure or original game behavior changes.",
    "Remove the now-unused CursorNextDangerMsg2 fixed-address constant and revise directly attached unresolved-view description, preserving the real16-byte first diagnostic object and all original markers/claims/history. Do not invent original object capacity, original readonly status, Console ownership or pooled cross-TU literal identity. Literal binding publication is coordinator-only after actual original/current correspondence; leave uncertainty explicit.",
    "Adapt the existing actual-source cursor diagnostic/storage tests that currently require opaque fixed-address argument, preserving parity normalization, debug gates, argument ordering, first text storage and all damage controls. Add concise original operand/zero-initialization and actual-source empty argument controls for the four key handler sites without copying the massive key handler implementation. No ad hoc PE parser or copied instruction-byte fixtures. Prefer extending existing tests over another giant mock harness.",
    "Host-only isolated worker; no native compiler/Wine, Git, framework edits, source marker/claim changes, task-journal edits or unrelated comment cleanup. Return scope discoveries. Coordinator retains compiler leases, source annotation publication, original/C++ review, build/link, measurements/preservation and integration. Correcting mistranslated argument values is not fixing an original game bug. No automatic/game acceptance follows."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover ordinary empty-string diagnostic arguments in Console, eliminating a fixed original address and four incorrect StringTable substitutions.",
